w-cost portable pocket router.\n\n\nUsing StickbotDUO with a VPN to simulate a LAN WIFI across the internet: NOT TESTED\n\nMulti-player mode works even without internet connection, manual ip entry instead supported instead.", "short_description": "StickbotDUO lets you dance with your mirror bot, or with a friend with another Quest 2 or 3 using your local WIFI. If internet access is not available, StickbotDUO shows local ip addresses to share with each other."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1yoz_u_ZBN883uI4H4c54Da69kIorsDypjN2DXn6bBmM/edit?tab=t.0", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "amre-amer.com", "support_website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LOFFleOUyG4_YQE0ALAhgEyKZ939ShYJBmesxfhBRfA/edit?usp=sharing", "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/amre-amer.com/resume/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24882541351381234"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "721513864273105"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "721513864273105"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1759433040, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "721513864273105"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_resu